Dedicated enforcing logging domains: persistent logcat, a read-only hardware snapshot and temporary bounded Elantech input capture. Input permits reads and identification/capability/axis/state-query ioctls, never grabs, setting changes or event injection. Drop the touchpad domain with its collector after diagnosis.

